    (https://github.com/calad0i/da4ml). GNU Lesser General Public License
    v3.0 (LGPL-3.0). They remain under LGPL-3.0; you may replace them with
    any compatible implementation. The other files under rtl/gen/ are output
    of the da4ml generator for this project's trained model; rtl/gen/qec_d5_lc3bc
    is that output with pipeline registers inserted by synth/scripts/add_bcast.py.

USRP X310 / RFNoC (Stage 5), from UHD 4.9 (https://github.com/EttusResearch/uhd, commit a5d1b2e):
rtl/x310/noc_shell_nsclf.sv, evidence/stage5/block/build/rfnoc_image_core.{sv,vh},
