rtl/x310/rfnoc_block_nsclf.sv, tb/rfnoc_block_nsclf_tb.sv, sw/x310/uhdsim/*/Makefile,
evidence/stage5/toolchain/tap_probe/rfnoc_block_tap.*.sv
    Derived from the UHD rfnoc_modtool block, testbench and Makefile templates,
    whose generated headers read GPL-3.0-or-later. Treat these files as
