evidence/stage5/toolchain/uhd_clone_edits.patch
    A patch against three UHD files (fpga/usrp3/lib/axi4s_sv/axi4s_fifo.sv,
    fpga/usrp3/tools/make/viv_preamble.mak, fpga/usrp3/tools/scripts/viv_generate_ip.tcl);
