Data
----
ref/golden/jsc_* vectors are derived from the hls4ml LHC jet dataset (HLF),
OpenML 42468, CC-BY-4.0, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.3602260
(Pierini, Duarte, Tran, Freytsis, Loncar).
ref/golden/qec_* vectors are this project's own Stim simulations of the
rotated surface-code memory experiment (ref/qec/qec_data.py,
ref/qec/qec_data_d5.py), released with the repository under Apache-2.0.

